 <section class="ck-hero"><div><span class="ck-eyebrow" style="color:#BBD8EA">PREPARATION OVERVIEW</span><h2>Small steps, big opportunities.</h2><p>Select a scholarship below to review its sample requirements, tick off what you've prepared, and watch your progress grow.</p></div><div class="ck-total"><div><b id="ck-scholarship-count">0</b><small>Scholarships</small></div><div><b id="ck-finished-count">0</b><small>Ready</small></div></div></section>
 <div class="ck-toolbar"><h2>Your scholarship checklists</h2><label class="ck-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg><input id="ck-search" type="search" placeholder="Search scholarships..." aria-label="Search scholarships"></label></div>
